<title>FRANCE: EU granted 273,500 T free-market wheat -official.</title>
<headline>EU granted 273,500 T free-market wheat -official.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted licences to export 273,500 tonnes of free-market soft wheat at a maximum rebate of 11.47 Ecus per tonne, an EU grain official said.</p>
<p>Earlier traders had reported that the EU awarded licences for the export of 263,500 tonnes of free-market soft wheat at a rebate of 11.47 Ecus per tonne.</p>
</text>
